    turnFlow: '1. Initial Deal: 3 cards (2 down, 1 up). Betting starts with the low card (Bring-In).\n2. Streets 4-6: One card dealt face-up per player. Betting occurs after each deal.\n3. The 2-Rule: If anyone receives a 2 face-up, they immediately get one extra face-up card before the next player is dealt. Some players may hold more than seven cards.\n4. Showdown: Best five-card poker hand wins. 3s and 6s are wild; Five-of-a-Kind is highest.',
